on the current bars."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["Window covers 120 closed D1 bars from 1779667200000 to 1790035199999; window low 1368.42 (bar 13), window high 2850 (bar 120).", "Bars 1-13 sell off from 2139.34 (bar 1 high) to 1368.42 (bar 13 low), -36.0%; bar 13 (O1581.32 H1599.27 L1368.42 C1568.55) closes with a 200.13-point lower tail, and bar 14 (O1568.55 H1690.78 L1563.52 C1687.83) is a large bull bar closing near its high.", "Bars 14-86 build a 73-bar base between 1512.91 (bar 33 low) and 1974.46 (bar 64 high) with dense bar overlap and rising lows in the second half (1694.74 bar 40, 1821.49 bar 71, 1868.42 bar 78, 1875.03 bar 83).", "Bar 87 (O1916.51 H2293.8 L1905.63 C2252.16) is a bull spike bar with a 335.65 body, about +17.5% from its open, closing 41.64 below its high; bar 88 closes 2326.32; bar 89 spikes to 2771 and closes 2515.30 with a 255.70 upper tail.", "Bars 90-116 form a 27-bar range between 2357.18 (bar 101 low) and 2680 (bar 110 high); most bars trade 2386-2557 with repeated upside probes closing back inside: bar 110 H2680/C2514.72, bar 113 H2609.02/C2514.07, bar 118 H2700/C2632.98.", "Bars 117-120 close 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.90 and 2775.61, each above the prior close, starting from bar 117's 2446.22 open.", "Bar 120 (O2642.9 H2850 L2641.7 C2775.61) has a 208.3 range, a 132.71 bull body, closes at 64% of its range with a 74.39 upper tail; the close 2775.61 is 75.61 above the post-spike range high 2700 and 4.61 above the window's prior high 2771.", "Ordered read: bear selloff, long base, bull spike out of that base, 27-bar consolidation holding above the spike low, then a four-bar push to new window highs."], "phase": "breakout-spike", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Opening bear selloff from the window high 2139.34 (bar 1) to 1368.42 (bar 13 low): 13 bars of mostly lower closes with ranges expanding to 230.85 on bar 13, whose 200.13 lower tail shows sellers giving up the low; immediately reversed by the large bull bar 14.", "end_time_ms": 1780790399999, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1779667200000, "upper_boundary": "2139.34"}, {"description": "Long base/consolidation after the selloff, 1512.91 (bar 33 low) to 1974.46 (bar 64 high). Bars 14-38 chop roughly 1550-1845; bars 39-86 drift up with higher lows and repeated tests of 1900-1975; heavy overlap throughout, typical range behavior.", "end_time_ms": 1787097599999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "1512.91", "start_time_ms": 1780790400000, "upper_boundary": "1974.46"}, {"description": "Three-bar bull spike out of the base. Bar 87 (O1916.51 H2293.8 L1905.63 C2252.16) is a 335.65-body bull trend bar closing 41.64 below its high; bar 88 closes 2326.32; bar 89 spikes to 2771 and closes 2515.30, leaving a 255.70 upper tail.", "end_time_ms": 1787356799999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "1905.63", "start_time_ms": 1787097600000, "upper_boundary": "2771"}, {"description": "27-bar two-sided range following the spike, 2357.18 (bar 101 low) to 2680 (bar 110 high). Dense overlap; the bulk of bars trade 2386-2557 and each upside probe closes back inside (bar 110 H2680/C2514.72, bar 113 H2609.02/C2514.07, bar 118 H2700/C2632.98).", "end_time_ms": 1789603199999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1787356800000, "upper_boundary": "2680"}, {"description": "Current four-bar up leg and upside breakout attempt above the 27-bar range: closes 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.90 and 2775.61 from bar 117's 2446.22 open. Bar 120 (O2642.9 H2850 L2641.7 C2775.61) closes above the range high 2700 and 4.61 above the window's prior high 2771, but 74.39 below its own high, so acceptance is not yet shown.", "end_time_ms": 1790035199999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2436.87", "start_time_ms": 1789689600000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "D1", "transition_conditions": ["Bull continuation: a close above 2850, or a second consecutive close above 2771 with the bar closing in its upper third, would confirm acceptance above the range and support trend continuation.", "Failed breakout: a close back below 2700, and especially below 2680 (bar 110 high), re-entering the 2357.18-2680 range, would mark bar 120's push as a failed breakout, particularly if the bar closes near its low.", "Range continuation: continued overlap with highs capped near 2771-2850 and no new closing high would keep the phase as range and shift the regime read toward trading-range.", "Trend damage: a close below 2436.87 (bar 117 low) negates the four-bar leg; a close below 2357.18 (bar 101 low) ends the post-spike higher-low sequence and turns the read to transition-unclear or trading-range.", "Deep failure: acceptance below 2111 (bar 88 low) would invalidate the spike structure and return the pre-spike base to relevance."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}, "H4": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790078399999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["The window is dominated by a two-sided range: 2358.62 (bar 80) to 2700 (bars 102 and 112) covers bars 55-113, and the window high 2850 (bar 114) is still unconfirmed.", "The bar-114 spike leaves a 126.85 upper tail and closes at 2723.15, far below its 2850 high, which is compatible with an exhaustion/climax spike rather than a clean trending bar.", "No follow-through to a new high after bar 114: bars 115-117 print 2795, 2770.03 and 2804.59, all below 2850, and the two most recent bars (118-119) are bear bars.", "Precedent for spike-and-fail in this window: the bar-7 spike (high 2509.15) was reversed by bar 13 (close 2450.96) and the bar-55 spike (high 2680) was followed by the bear leg into 2358.62 (bars 75-80).", "Recent bars overlap heavily (bars 108-113 closes 2577.88, 2611, 2631.93, 2642.9, 266